#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:5
msgid "ガウス過程回帰"
msgstr "Gaussian Process Regression"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:9
msgid "動機付け"
msgstr "Motivation"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"式 :eq:`pgp6` において、データ数とパラメータ数が等しい、すなわち :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` "
"が正方行列となるケースを考える"
msgstr ""
"In Equation :eq:`pgp6`, consider the case where the number of data points"
" equals the number of parameters, so that :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` is "
"a square matrix."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"y_1 \\\\\n"
"y_2 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"y_N\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"w_0 \\\\\n"
"w_1 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"w_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"y_1 \\\\\n"
"y_2 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"y_N\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"w_0 \\\\\n"
"w_1 \\\\\n"
"\\vdots \\\\\n"
"w_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"さらに :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` が正則であるとして、上式を :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` "
"について解く"
msgstr ""
"Assume further that :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}` is invertible and solve "
"the equation above for :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"= \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{y} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{w}\n"
"= \\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{y} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"パラメータ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` に対する事前分布として、平均 0、分散 :math:`\\alpha^{-1}` "
"の等方的なガウス分布"
msgstr ""
"For the prior distribution of the parameters :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`, "
"consider the isotropic Gaussian distribution with mean 0 and variance "
":math:`\\alpha^{-1}`."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:49
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\propto\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\\right)}"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\propto\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\\right)}"
"\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:55
msgid "を考え、ここに式 :eq:`gp2` を代入すると次式が得られる"
msgstr ""
"Substituting Equation :eq:`gp2` into this prior gives the following "
"expression."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:57
msgid ""
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\\right)}"
"\n"
"=\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-\\top}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}\\right)}"
"\n"
"=\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top\n"
"\\left(\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\right)^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}\\right)}"
" .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{w}^\\top\\boldsymbol{w}\\right)}"
"\n"
"=\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-\\top}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}\\right)}"
"\n"
"=\n"
"\\exp{\\left(-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top\n"
"\\left(\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\\right)^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}\\right)}"
" .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"上式はパラメータ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` が消去され、代わりに :math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` "
"に対する事前分布を与えた式となっている。式 :eq:`gp1` から"
msgstr ""
"The equation above eliminates the parameters :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` and "
"gives a prior distribution for :math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` instead. Equation "
":eq:`gp1` gives the following matrix product."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots"
" & \\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}^\\top\n"
"=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_0(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & "
"\\phi_1(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"\\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots"
" & \\phi_{N-1}(\\boldsymbol{x}_N) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:86
msgid "であり、"
msgstr "We then define the function"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:88
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_i, \\boldsymbol{x}_j)\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\alpha^{-1}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} \\phi_n(\\boldsymbol{x}_i) "
"\\phi_n(\\boldsymbol{x}_j)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_i, \\boldsymbol{x}_j)\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\alpha^{-1}\\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} \\phi_n(\\boldsymbol{x}_i) "
"\\phi_n(\\boldsymbol{x}_j)\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:94
msgid "という関数を定義して、これを要素とする行列を"
msgstr "and the matrix whose entries are its values,"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{K}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{K}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_2, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\cdots & \\cdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_2) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) "
"\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid "と置くと、\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` の事前分布は次のように書ける"
msgstr ""
"With these definitions, the prior distribution for \\ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` can be written as follows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:109
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N\\left| \\boldsymbol{K} \\right|}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top \\boldsymbol{K}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N\\left| \\boldsymbol{K} \\right|}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{y}^\\top \\boldsymbol{K}^{-1} \\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\\right)} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"以上より、パラメータ\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` を経由することなく、 \\ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` についての確率分布を直接的に扱う定式化の可能性が示唆される。\\ "
"そうすることで、基底関数やパラメータの数の増大で計算が困難になる、いわゆる「次元の呪い」から解放される事になる。"
msgstr ""
"This derivation suggests that we may be able to formulate the problem "
"without going through the parameters \\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`, by "
"working directly with the probability distribution of \\ "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{y}`.\\  Such a formulation would free us from the so-"
"called curse of dimensionality, in which computation becomes difficult as"
" the number of basis functions or parameters grows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:125
msgid "ガウス過程との関係"
msgstr "Relation to Gaussian Processes"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:127
msgid "いま、多数の（あるいは連続的な）データから、任意に :math:`N` 個のデータを取り出すことを考える"
msgstr ""
"Consider an arbitrary selection of :math:`N` data points from a large or "
"continuous collection."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\{y_1, y_2, \\dots, y_N\\} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\{y_1, y_2, \\dots, y_N\\} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:133
msgid ""
"この\\ :math:`N` 個のデータの同時分布が、式 :eq:`gp5` のような多変量ガウス分布であるとき、\\ "
"これは「ガウス過程」と呼ばれる確率過程の定義そのものになっている。\\ もちろん今はデータのラベルに時間の意味はないが、この対応から、式 "
":eq:`gp5` の確率分布を利用した回帰は「ガウス過程回帰」と呼ばれる。"
msgstr ""
"If the joint distribution of these \\ :math:`N` data points is a "
"multivariate Gaussian distribution of the form in Equation :eq:`gp5`,\\  "
"the defining condition for the stochastic process called a Gaussian "
"process is met.\\  The labels here do not represent time, but this "
"correspondence is why regression using the probability distribution in "
"Equation :eq:`gp5` is called Gaussian process regression."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:141
msgid "出力にノイズがある場合"
msgstr "When the Outputs Contain Noise"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:143
msgid "出力データにノイズがあり、次のような形でデータが生成される場合を考える"
msgstr ""
"Consider the case where the outputs contain noise and the data are "
"generated as follows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{t} = \\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{t} = \\boldsymbol{y} + \\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:149
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{y}` が与えられた時の :math:`\\boldsymbol{t}` の分布を"
msgstr ""
"Given \\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{y}`, suppose we model the distribution of "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{t}` as follows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:151
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})^\\top (\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})"
"\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})^\\top (\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{y})"
"\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:161
#, python-brace-format
msgid "でモデル化するとき、\\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{t}` の周辺分布は"
msgstr ""
"Under this model, the marginal distribution of \\ :math:`\\boldsymbol{t}`"
" is given by the following integral."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:163
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"=\n"
"\\int\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"d\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"=\n"
"\\int\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"p(\\boldsymbol{y})\n"
"d\\boldsymbol{y}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:172
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と計算される。これを :eq:`gp5` および :eq:`gp6` を用いて計算すると（\\ :math:`\\beta \\equiv "
"\\sigma^{-2}_\\varepsilon` とおく）"
msgstr ""
"Evaluating this integral using Equations :eq:`gp5` and :eq:`gp6`, with \\"
" :math:`\\beta \\equiv \\sigma^{-2}_\\varepsilon`, gives"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:174
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N\\left| \\boldsymbol{K} + "
"\\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I} \\right|}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}^\\top\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{K} + \\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I} \\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N\\left| \\boldsymbol{K} + "
"\\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I} \\right|}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}^\\top\n"
"\\left( \\boldsymbol{K} + \\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I} \\right)^{-1}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:186
msgid "が得られる。これは、共分散行列を"
msgstr "Now consider the following replacement for the covariance matrix."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{K} \\longrightarrow \\boldsymbol{K} + "
"\\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{K} \\longrightarrow \\boldsymbol{K} + "
"\\beta^{-1}\\boldsymbol{I}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:192
msgid "と置き換えれば :eq:`gp5` と本質的には同じものであることがわかる。"
msgstr ""
"With this replacement, the result is essentially the same as Equation "
":eq:`gp5`."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:196
msgid "予測分布"
msgstr "Predictive Distribution"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:198
msgid "いま、\\ :math:`N_1` 個の入出力データのセットがあるとして、新たな :math:`N` 個の入力と対応する出力を"
msgstr ""
"Suppose we have \\ :math:`N_1` input–output pairs. We denote the "
":math:`N` new inputs and their corresponding outputs as follows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:200
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{X}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{\\boldsymbol{x}_{1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_{2}, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N}\\} ,\\\\\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{t_{1}, t_{2}, \\dots, t_{N}\\}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{X}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{\\boldsymbol{x}_{1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_{2}, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N}\\} ,\\\\\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{t_{1}, t_{2}, \\dots, t_{N}\\}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:209
msgid "と表し、入出力がそろっている :math:`N_1` 個の（既知の）データを"
msgstr "We denote the :math:`N_1` known input–output pairs as follows."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:211
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{X}_{N_1}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_{N+2}, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}\\} ,\\\\\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}_{N_1}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{t_{N+1}, t_{N+2}, \\dots, t_{N+N_1}\\} \\\\\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{X}_{N_1}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_{N+2}, \\dots, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}\\} ,\\\\\\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{t}_{N_1}\n"
"&\\equiv\n"
"\\{t_{N+1}, t_{N+2}, \\dots, t_{N+N_1}\\} \\\\\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:220
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"と表すことにする。関数 :math:`k(\\boldsymbol{x}, \\boldsymbol{x}')` の形も与えられているとして、 "
"共分散行列をブロック行列の形で以下のように定義する"
msgstr ""
"Also assume that the function :math:`k(\\boldsymbol{x}, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}')` is given. Define the covariance matrix in the "
"following block matrix form."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:223
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{K}_{NN} & \\boldsymbol{K}_{NN_1} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{K}_{N_1N} & \\boldsymbol{K}_{N_1N_1} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N}) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_1, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N}) & \\cdots & k(\\boldsymbol{x}_N, "
"\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}) \\\\\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots \\\\\n"
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_1) & \\cdots & "
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_N) & \\cdots & "
"k(\\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}, \\boldsymbol{x}_{N+N_1}) \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\boldsymbol{K}_{NN} & \\boldsymbol{K}_{NN_1} \\\\\n"
"\\boldsymbol{K}_{N_1N} & \\boldsymbol{K}_{N_1N_1} \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\equiv\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
