msgid "再生核（定義）"
msgstr "Reproducing Kernel (Definition)"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:479
msgid "関数 :math:`f(x)` と、ヒルベルト空間の要素としての :math:`f` をあまり区別せず、おおらかに定義を述べると、"
msgstr ""
"Stated loosely, without drawing a sharp distinction between the function "
":math:`f(x)` and the Hilbert space element :math:`f`, the defining "
"property is"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:482
msgid ""
"\\int k(x,x') f(x') dx' = f(x)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\int k(x,x') f(x') dx' = f(x)\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:485
msgid "となるような関数 :math:`k(x,x')` を「再生核」と呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"A function :math:`k(x,x')` satisfying this identity is called a "
"reproducing kernel."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:488
msgid "ムーア・アロンシャインの定理"
msgstr "Moore–Aronszajn Theorem"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:490
msgid "正定値対称な関数 :math:`k(x,x')` があれば、これに付随するヒルベルト空間（再生核ヒルベルト空間）が一意に定まる"
msgstr ""
"A symmetric positive-definite function :math:`k(x,x')` uniquely "
"determines an associated Hilbert space (the reproducing kernel Hilbert "
"space)."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:493
msgid "Representer定理"
msgstr "Representer Theorem"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:495
msgid "次のような正則化項付きの損失関数を考える"
msgstr "Consider the following loss function with a regularization term."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:497
msgid ""
"L\n"
"=\n"
"E\\left[ (x_1, y_1, f(x_1)), (x_2, y_2, f(x_2)), \\dots, (x_N, y_N, "
"f(x_N)) \\right]\n"
"+\n"
"\\Phi(\\|f\\|^2) ,\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"L\n"
"=\n"
"E\\left[ (x_1, y_1, f(x_1)), (x_2, y_2, f(x_2)), \\dots, (x_N, y_N, "
"f(x_N)) \\right]\n"
"+\n"
"\\Phi(\\|f\\|^2) ,\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:504
msgid "ここで正則化項 :math:`\\Phi` は単調増加関数であるとする。このとき、上式を最小化する :math:`f(x)` は、次の形に書ける"
msgstr ""
"Assume that the regularization term :math:`\\Phi` is a monotonically "
"increasing function. Under this assumption, the function :math:`f(x)` "
"that minimizes the expression above can be written in the following form."

#: ../../ml/gaussian_process.rst:506
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"f(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^N c_i k(x, x_i) .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"f(x) = \\sum_{i=1}^N c_i k(x, x_i) .\n"
"\n"

